== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[þrjátíu]]'' meaning "[[thirty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[níu]]'' "[[nine]]". Meaning '''thirty and nine'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''þrjátíu og níu''' {{indecl}}

# [[thirty-nine]], cardinal number after [[þrjátíu og átta]] and before [[fjörtíu]]

